# Conformance probe pack for commas in `const` (spec 0.20, ruling 28) on
# `json`. Public. No kinds. A `const` value is one literal value: a comma,
# and `..`, are text.
#
#   x, then the constants c = "a,b" and d = "1..3"
format     conformance-kinds-const
version    0.20.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       json
field  probe.x  x  int
const  c  a,b
const  d  1..3
